  "description": "✅Betaal gemakkelijk met iDEAL-in-3✅<br>\r\n<br>\r\n✨ Betaal in 3 termijnen – 0% rente! ✨<br>\r\n<br>\r\n‼️ Geldig voor aankopen tot €600 ‼️<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Productomschrijving:</b><br>\r\n<br>\r\nConditie: ZGAN<br>\r\nMeegeleverd: -<br>\r\nGarantie: 1 Maand<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIf you're looking for a complete bike and want the absolute best of the best, then look no further. The Soundwave Special by Sunday Bikes is built 100% from Sunday and Odyssey aftermarket parts, ensuring top-end components everywhere and a complete that rides like a custom.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTo list a few of its parts, it's built around the strong and ultra-popular Soundwave V3 frame, comes with Odyssey's Clutch V2 freecoaster hub and Odyssey Thunderbolt+ cranks.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPro rider Gary Young rides this bike on a daily, and it's referred to as his signature bike.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPart list:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Sunday Soundwave V3 frame, made 100% from 41-Thermal® processed Chromoly<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Sunday Darkwave fork, made 100% from 41-Thermal® processed Chromoly, 28mm offset<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Sunday Freeze top load alloy stem, 48mm length and 34mm rise<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Super Highway handlebars, made 100% from in a classic 2-piece construction<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Clutch V2 freecoaster rear hub with 14mm female axle and a non-drive plastic hub guard<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Vandero Pro front hub with 10mm (3/8\") female axles and 2x plastic hub guards<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Springfield U-brake with - Odyssey's Monolever and Quik Slic cable<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Slugger Stich pivotal seat with Odyssey post and seat clamp<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Utility Pro 25T sprocket with plastic sprocket guard mounted<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Thunderbolt+ cranks with 170mm arms, made 100% from Thermal® processed Chromoly<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Hazard Lite double-walled rims, ridden by many pros due to its weight-to-strength ratio<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Path Pro tires, 2.4\" both in front and rear<br>\r\n<br>\r\n- Odyssey Twisted PC Pro pedals and Warnin' grips<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n14 dagen bedenktijd met gratis retourzending (alleen voor online aankopen)<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLet op: niet geldig bij nieuwe producten waarvan de verzegeling is verbroken en het product is gebruikt.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAlle producten zijn volledig getest en gecontroleerd<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Conditie-indeling van onze producten:</b><br>\r\n<br>\r\nRedelijk: Zichtbare gebruikssporen en/of krassen, gedeeltelijk of volledig functioneel. Zie product omschrijving. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nGoed: Zichtbaar lichte gebruikssporen en/of krassen, volledig functioneel.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nZeer goed: Weinig tot geen zichtbare gebruikssporen, volledig functioneel.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nZGAN (Zo Goed Als Nieuw): Perfecte staat, minimale of geen gebruikssporen, volledig functioneel<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNieuw uit seal: Product geopend voor veiligheidscontrole, nooit gebruikt.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNieuw in seal: 100% nieuw, fabrieksverzegeld, nooit geopend.",
